<title>JAPAN: SUMITOMO RUBBER LIFTS 1997 TYRE OUTPUT FORECASTS.</title>
<headline>SUMITOMO RUBBER LIFTS 1997 TYRE OUTPUT FORECASTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Rubber Industries Ltd said on Wednesday it had revised up its forecast for tyre production in calendar 1997 to 139,000 tonnes from an earlier estimate of 135,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>The upward revision was due to better-than-expected tyre exports, particularly to Southeast Asia, backed by a weaker yen against the dollar, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>Sumitomo Rubber Industries Ltd is the third largest tyre maker in Japan.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk (81) 3-3432-7391)</p>
